fixture oneway_lip_step_down_then_drop
doc walk right off a 4 u lip lying on a one-way (test/oneway_lip): the walk steps down onto the one-way and stays on the ground; then crouch and drop through it.
room test/oneway_lip
spawn 400 316
frames 50
input
  0..19 R
  20..24 -
  25..27 D
  28 D jump
  29..49 -
end
expect
  never 0..27 state=air
  at 19 y=320u
  at 28 event.drop_through=1
  at 40 y>330u
end
